      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RIPPED RACCOON (2) won again and recorded an impressive time after leading making it four on end, scoring by 1.5 lengths (18.23) at Richmond over 320m. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Looks the one to beat. SHE'S SILKY (1) is struggling to break through but racing consistently, finishing in the minors three starts on end. Last time out flew the lids with a fast early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when second (17.65) at this track over 300m. Ready to find winning form. RATTLIN' BYE (7) has missed the frame the last couple but was a Grade 5 winner three back (22.99) at Maitland over 400m. Can improve sharply here. KEYLIN (8) gets a chance to redeem an unplaced effort here last start.",
